@startuml PostureCare_Sequence
!theme plain
title PostureCare Data Flow - Sequence Diagram v2.0

participant Operator
participant CSVFile as "CSV File"
participant Parser as "CSV Ingester\n(Python)"
participant PushGW as "Push Gateway\n(9091)"
participant Prom as "Prometheus\n(9090)"
participant GraphQL as "GraphQL API\n(8000)"
participant Redis as "Redis\n(6379)"
participant Grafana as "Grafana\n(3000)"

Operator -> Parser: ingest-csv.py / realtime_csv_streamer.py
activate Parser
Parser -> CSVFile: Read live or batch rows
Parser -> Parser: Parse, validate, normalize
note right of Parser
  Validate columns
  Validate timestamps
  Normalize sensor frames
end note

Parser -> Parser: Convert to Prometheus metrics
Parser -> PushGW: HTTP POST metrics
activate PushGW
PushGW -> PushGW: Buffer for scrape
note right of PushGW
  Measurement labels preserved
  Ready for Prometheus scrape
end note

Parser -> GraphQL: Seed or publish demo data
activate GraphQL
GraphQL -> Prom: Push synthetic metrics
GraphQL -> Redis: Publish real-time event
note right of GraphQL
  Authenticated API access
  Queries and subscriptions
end note

Prom -> PushGW: GET /metrics
activate Prom
PushGW --> Prom: Return all metrics
Prom -> Prom: Store in TSDB
note right of Prom
  15-day retention
  PromQL query support
end note

Operator -> GraphQL: Query patient/session data
GraphQL -> Prom: Read telemetry metrics
GraphQL -> Redis: Check pub/sub cache
GraphQL -> GraphQL: Resolve schema + auth
note right of GraphQL
  /graphql endpoint
  API keys required for private resolvers
end note

Operator -> Grafana: Open browser\nhttp://localhost:3000
activate Grafana
note right of Operator
  Login: admin/admin
end note

Grafana -> Prom: PromQL query
Prom --> Grafana: Time-series data
Grafana --> Operator: Display dashboards
note right of Grafana
  Patient Monitoring
  Research Analytics
  System Health
  Sensor/Device Telemetry
end note

@enduml
